  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies options for a private key and certificate chain that <see cref="M:Android.App.Admin.DevicePolicyManager.InstallKeyPair(Android.Content.ComponentName,Java.Security.IPrivateKey,Java.Security.Cert.Certificate[],System.String,Android.App.Admin.InstallKeyFlags)" /> installs.</summary>
    <remarks><para><see cref="F:Android.App.Admin.InstallKeyFlags.RequestCredentialsAccess" /> grants the calling app access to the installed credentials immediately. <see cref="F:Android.App.Admin.InstallKeyFlags.SetUserSelectable" /> lets the user select the key in the certificate selection prompt. Android accepts both options in the same flags value.</para></remarks>
  </Docs>
