      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Allows a user to select the key in the certificate selection prompt. Without this flag, an administrator can still choose an alias using <see cref="M:Android.App.Admin.DeviceAdminReceiver.OnChoosePrivateKeyAlias(Android.Content.Context,Android.Content.Intent,System.Int32,Android.Net.Uri,System.String)" />, and <see cref="F:Android.App.Admin.InstallKeyFlags.RequestCredentialsAccess" /> can grant the calling app access when the key is installed.</para>
